   "_note": "47 tiles = every canonical 8-neighbour land mask (blob set). Role 'water' is open water (theme terrain_assets water -> tile.water). water_edge_<side>: land on that screen side (ne = world +y, se = +x, sw = -y, nw = -x); water_outer_<corner>: land on the two sides meeting at that corner (n, e, s, w); water_inner_<corner>: land only on that diagonal; water_channel_*: land on two opposite sides; water_mNNN: any other mask, NNN = side bits ne 1, se 2, sw 4, nw 8 + corner bits n 16, e 32, s 64, w 128 (a corner bit only when both sides next to it are water). The renderer picks the tile from the cell's 8 neighbours (missing/mwater.py code_of).",
